# Graven Cairns: "{B/R}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{R}, or {R}{R}." The {B/R} must be paid with black or red mana. Turn 3 the
# Cairns and a Plains are all Bot1 has: the filter ability is not offered (a Plains makes {W}, which pays neither half).
# Turn 5, with a Swamp played, the same ability is offered and a Swamp pays it.

